# Package-manager configuration lives in pnpm-workspace.yaml.
#
# Do not put pnpm build settings here:
#   - `onlyBuiltDependencies` is read ONLY from pnpm-workspace.yaml (pnpm 10), so a
#     block here is silently ignored and misleads readers.
#   - Unknown keys in this file trigger "Unknown project config" warnings and break
#     plain `npm` invocations.
#   - `node-linker=hoisted` (needed by electron-builder) is passed through the
#     environment (`npm_config_node_linker`) by the CI workflow and build-local.ps1
#     instead of being written to disk.
